[node name="Wardrobe" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Two-door wardrobe with an LED strip (kept for other apartments), 1.50 x 0.60 x 2.10 m. Origin = bottom center, front faces +Z. Doors hinge on the outer edges and open outward (0..95 degrees) by their handles, swing on after release and catch when nearly closed. Two drawers slide out 0.40 m; the storage box and its lid are pickables; the hangers can be taken off the rail and hung back. Things can be put on the shelves."

